<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/0156015918b91eac9b675bdf92489af894da9103#block_33> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def set_expression(self, expression):\n        self.expression = expression\n        self.lex_position = len(expression)\n        self.token_type = None\n        self.token_value = None\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        # self.lex_position +1 to account for the starting double quote char.\n        underline = ' ' * (self.lex_position + 1) + '^'\n        return (\n            'Invalid jmespath expression: Incomplete expression:\\n'\n            '\"%s\"\\n%s' % (self.expression, underline))" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/0156015918b91eac9b675bdf92489af894da9103> .
